{
  "U-Frame (C-Frame)": "U 形尺架（C 形架）",
  "Rigid backbone of the instrument": "整把量具的刚性骨架",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Structure</span><h3>U-Frame (C-Frame)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">结构</span><h3>U 形尺架（C 形架）</h3>",
  "<p>The drop-forged steel arc that carries everything else. Its whole job is <strong>rigidity</strong>: any flex between anvil and spindle appears directly in the reading, so the frame is deep, ribbed and deliberately heavy for its size.</p>": "<p>模锻出来的钢质弧形本体，其余部件都装在它上面。它唯一的任务就是<strong>刚性</strong>：测砧与测微螺杆之间只要有丝毫变形，就会直接进入读数，所以尺架做得又厚、又带加强筋，相对尺寸来说刻意做得很沉。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Holds the anvil and the barrel assembly in one rigid line</li><li>Plastic heat-insulating pads keep hand warmth out of the steel &mdash; a 1&nbsp;&deg;C rise in a 25&nbsp;mm frame is a couple of microns</li><li>Frame size fixes the range: 0&ndash;25, 25&ndash;50, 50&ndash;75&nbsp;mm are separate instruments</li></ul>": "<ul><li>把测砧和套筒组件固定在同一条刚性直线上</li><li>塑料隔热片挡住手温 &mdash; 25&nbsp;mm 的尺架温度升高 1&nbsp;&deg;C，尺寸就要变几个微米</li><li>尺架大小决定量程：0&ndash;25、25&ndash;50、50&ndash;75&nbsp;mm 是三把不同的量具</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Workshop habit:</strong> hold the frame by the insulator pads, not the bare steel &mdash; and never clamp it in a vice without soft jaws.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>车间习惯：</strong>捏隔热片，不要直接握钢件 &mdash; 也绝不要不上软爪就把它夹在台虎钳里。</div>",
  "Fixed measuring face": "固定的测量面",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Measuring</span><h3>Anvil</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">测量</span><h3>测砧</h3>",
  "<p>The <strong>fixed</strong> measuring face, pressed into the left end of the frame. The workpiece rests against it while the spindle closes in from the other side.</p>": "<p><strong>固定</strong>的测量面，压配在尺架左端。工件靠在它上面，测微螺杆从另一侧合拢过来。</p>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Face material</dt><dd>Tungsten carbide tip</dd><dt>Face finish</dt><dd>Lapped optically flat</dd><dt>Face &Oslash;</dt><dd>&asymp; 6.5 mm</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>测量面材料</dt><dd>硬质合金头</dd><dt>测量面精度</dt><dd>研磨至光学平面</dd><dt>测量面直径</dt><dd>&asymp; 6.5 mm</dd></dl>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Check it:</strong> a worn or dinged anvil face shows as a zero error that no amount of careful reading will remove &mdash; test with an optical flat or a gauge block.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>检查方法：</strong>测砧面磨损或磕伤会表现为零误差，再仔细的读数也消不掉 &mdash; 用平晶或量块检验。</div>",
  "Moving measuring face": "可动的测量面",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Measuring</span><h3>Spindle</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">测量</span><h3>测微螺杆</h3>",
  "<p>The moving face. Inside the barrel its shank carries a precision-ground <strong>0.5&nbsp;mm pitch thread</strong> &mdash; one full turn of the thimble advances it exactly half a millimetre. That screw is the measuring element; everything else just reads it.</p>": "<p>可动的测量面。它的杆身在套筒内部带有一段精密磨制的<strong>0.5&nbsp;mm 螺距螺纹</strong> &mdash; 微分筒转整整一圈，它正好前进半毫米。真正承担测量的是这段螺纹，其余部件都只是把它读出来。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Face carbide-tipped and lapped, parallel to the anvil at every rotation</li><li>Hardened, ground and stabilised steel</li><li>Never spin the spindle onto the work &mdash; drive the last part-turn with the ratchet</li></ul>": "<ul><li>端面镶硬质合金并研磨，任何转角下都与测砧平行</li><li>淬火、磨制并经稳定化处理的钢材</li><li>绝不要让测微螺杆撞向工件 &mdash; 最后小半圈交给棘轮</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Why 0.5 mm pitch:</strong> LC = pitch &divide; thimble divisions = 0.5 &divide; 50 = <strong>0.01 mm</strong>. The screw IS the instrument.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>为什么是 0.5 mm 螺距：</strong>LC = 螺距 &divide; 微分筒分度数 = 0.5 &divide; 50 = <strong>0.01 mm</strong>。这段螺纹本身就是量具的核心。</div>",
  "Lock Nut / Lock Lever": "锁紧螺母 / 锁紧手柄",
  "Freezes the spindle": "锁住测微螺杆",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Control</span><h3>Lock Nut (Spindle Clamp)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">操作件</span><h3>锁紧螺母（螺杆夹紧）</h3>",
  "<p>A knurled ring (a lever on some patterns) that clamps the spindle so the reading cannot drift while you take the instrument off the work and hold it up to read.</p>": "<p>一个滚花环（有些型式是手柄），把测微螺杆夹住，这样你把量具从工件上取下、举起来读数时，尺寸不会跑掉。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Lock <em>after</em> the ratchet clicks, then withdraw and read</li><li>Also holds a size for comparative (go / no-go) checks</li><li>Clamp gently &mdash; it grips a precision screw, not a bolt</li></ul>": "<ul><li>棘轮响过<em>之后</em>再锁紧，然后取开读数</li><li>也可用来锁定尺寸做比较测量（通/止检查）</li><li>轻轻夹住即可 &mdash; 它夹的是精密螺纹，不是螺栓</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Habit to build:</strong> ratchet &rarr; lock &rarr; withdraw &rarr; read at eye level. It removes both drift and parallax in one move.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>要养成的习惯：</strong>棘轮 &rarr; 锁紧 &rarr; 取开 &rarr; 眼睛平视读数。一套动作同时消掉尺寸漂移和视差。</div>",
  "Sleeve / Barrel": "固定套筒",
  "Carries main scale + datum": "承载主尺与基准线",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Scale</span><h3>Sleeve (Barrel)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">刻度</span><h3>固定套筒</h3>",
  "<p>The stationary tube fixed to the frame. It is engraved with the <strong>datum line</strong> along its axis and the <strong>main scale</strong>, and the thimble sweeps over it as the spindle screws in and out.</p>": "<p>固定在尺架上的不动管件。它的轴向刻着<strong>基准线</strong>，还有<strong>主尺刻度</strong>；测微螺杆进出时，微分筒就在它上面滑动。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Stationary: everything on it is the fixed reference</li><li>On adjustable micrometers the sleeve can be rotated slightly with a C-spanner to zero the instrument</li></ul>": "<ul><li>不动件：它上面的一切都是固定基准</li><li>可调式千分尺上，可以用钩形扳手把套筒微转一点来对零</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Reading rule:</strong> the thimble edge is the cursor. Read the last main-scale mark it has fully exposed &mdash; never the next one.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>读数规则：</strong>微分筒边缘就是游标。读它已经完整露出的最后一条主尺刻线 &mdash; 绝不能读下一条。</div>",
  "mm above, half-mm below": "上方毫米，下方半毫米",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Scale</span><h3>Main Scale (Sleeve Scale)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">刻度</span><h3>主尺（套筒刻度）</h3>",
  "<p>Whole millimetres are engraved <strong>above</strong> the datum line and the <strong>half-millimetre</strong> marks below it (layouts vary by maker). The Main Scale Reading is everything the thimble edge has uncovered.</p>": "<p>整毫米刻在基准线<strong>上方</strong>，<strong>半毫米</strong>刻在下方（不同厂家排布略有差异）。主尺读数就是微分筒边缘露出来的全部内容。</p>",
  "<div class=\"formula-box\">MSR = whole mm + (0.5 mm if the half-mm mark is exposed)</div>": "<div class=\"formula-box\">MSR = 整毫米 +（半毫米刻线露出则加 0.5 mm）</div>",
  "<p>Missing an exposed half-mm mark is <em>the</em> classic micrometer error &mdash; it puts you out by exactly 0.50&nbsp;mm, because the same thimble number returns every half millimetre.</p>": "<p>漏看一条已经露出的半毫米刻线，是千分尺<em>最</em>经典错误 &mdash; 它让你正好差 0.50&nbsp;mm，因为同一个微分筒数字每半毫米就会出现一次。</p>",
  "Datum (Index) Line": "基准线（指示线）",
  "The reference line": "读数基准线",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Reading</span><h3>Datum (Reference) Line</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">读数</span><h3>基准线</h3>",
  "<p>The single horizontal line engraved along the sleeve. The thimble division that sits on this line <em>is</em> the Circular Scale Reading &mdash; nothing else on the thimble matters.</p>": "<p>套筒上纵贯的那一条横线。落在它上面那一格微分筒分度<em>就是</em>微分筒读数 &mdash; 微分筒上其他位置都不用看。</p>",
  "<ul><li>CSR = the thimble division aligned with this line</li><li>Read square-on: viewing at an angle shifts the apparent alignment (parallax)</li></ul>": "<ul><li>CSR = 与这条线对齐的那一格微分筒分度</li><li>要正对着读：斜着看会让对齐位置看起来偏移（视差）</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Between divisions?</strong> A micrometer is read to its least count &mdash; take the nearer division, never interpolate tenths by eye (that is a vernier micrometer’s job).</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>正好夹在两格之间？</strong>千分尺只读到最小分度值 &mdash; 取更近的那一格，不要用眼睛估十分之一（那是游标千分尺的活儿）。</div>",
  "Rotates with the spindle": "随测微螺杆一起转",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Structure</span><h3>Thimble</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">结构</span><h3>微分筒</h3>",
  "<p>The knurled sleeve your fingers turn. It is fixed to the spindle, so one revolution = one pitch = <strong>0.5&nbsp;mm</strong> of spindle travel, and its bevelled edge doubles as the cursor for the main scale.</p>": "<p>手指转动的那只滚花筒。它与测微螺杆固定在一起，所以转一圈 = 一个螺距 = 测微螺杆前进 <strong>0.5&nbsp;mm</strong>；它的斜口边缘同时充任主尺的游标。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Bevelled edge carries the 50-division circular scale</li><li>Knurling gives fine fingertip control</li><li>Use it for the approach &mdash; hand feel varies; the final contact belongs to the ratchet</li></ul>": "<ul><li>斜口边缘上刻着 50 个分度的微分刻度</li><li>滚花便于指尖精细控制</li><li>用它快速接近工件 &mdash; 手上力度不稳定，最后的接触交给棘轮</li></ul>",
  "Circular (Thimble) Scale": "微分筒刻度",
  "50 divisions × 0.01 mm": "50 分度 × 0.01 mm",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Scale</span><h3>Circular Scale (Thimble Scale)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">刻度</span><h3>微分筒刻度</h3>",
  "<p>Fifty divisions around the thimble’s bevel. Each division the datum line crosses is one least count of spindle travel.</p>": "<p>微分筒斜口上一圈 50 个分度。基准线每越过一格，测微螺杆就前进一个最小分度值。</p>",
  "<div class=\"formula-box\">LC = pitch &divide; divisions = 0.5 mm &divide; 50 = <strong>0.01 mm</strong></div>": "<div class=\"formula-box\">LC = 螺距 &divide; 分度数 = 0.5 mm &divide; 50 = <strong>0.01 mm</strong></div>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Metric</dt><dd>50 div &times; 0.01 mm = 0.5 mm/rev</dd><dt>Metric (fine)</dt><dd>100 div &times; 0.01 mm = 1 mm/rev</dd><dt>Imperial</dt><dd>25 div &times; 0.001&Prime; = 0.025&Prime;/rev</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>公制</dt><dd>50 分度 &times; 0.01 mm = 0.5 mm/转</dd><dt>公制（细）</dt><dd>100 分度 &times; 0.01 mm = 1 mm/转</dd><dt>英制</dt><dd>25 分度 &times; 0.001&Prime; = 0.025&Prime;/转</dd></dl>",
  "<p>Because one revolution is only half a millimetre, the circular scale repeats twice per millimetre &mdash; which is exactly why the half-mm mark on the sleeve must never be missed.</p>": "<p>由于一圈只走半毫米，微分筒刻度每毫米会重复两次 &mdash; 这正是套筒上那条半毫米刻线绝对不能漏看的原因。</p>",
  "Constant measuring force": "恒定的测量力",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Control</span><h3>Ratchet Stop</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">操作件</span><h3>棘轮止动器</h3>",
  "<p>The small spring-loaded cap at the end of the thimble. Turn <em>it</em> for the final closing: when the measuring force reaches its preset value (roughly 5&ndash;10&nbsp;N) the ratchet slips and clicks instead of tightening further.</p>": "<p>微分筒末端那个带弹簧的小盖。最后合拢要转<em>它</em>：当测量力达到预设值（约 5&ndash;10&nbsp;N）时，棘轮会打滑发出咔哒声，而不会继续夹紧。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Close on the work with <strong>2&ndash;3 clicks</strong>, every time, every operator</li><li>Removes the biggest human variable &mdash; grip strength</li><li>Skipping it flattens soft parts and springs the frame: both read wrong</li></ul>": "<ul><li>每次、每个人都用<strong>响 2&ndash;3 声</strong>来合拢工件</li><li>消除了最大的人为变量 &mdash; 手劲</li><li>省掉这一步会压扁软工件、把尺架撑变形：两种情况的读数都是错的</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Repeatability test:</strong> measure the same gauge block five times with the ratchet. The spread should be zero at 0.01 mm resolution.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>重复性检验：</strong>用棘轮把同一块量块量五次。在 0.01 mm 的分辨力下，五次的分散度应当是零。</div>",
  "The two measuring faces": "两个测量面",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Measuring</span><h3>Carbide jaws</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">测量</span><h3>硬质合金量爪</h3>",
  "<p>Two hardened jaws that press <strong>outwards</strong> against the bore. What the instrument reads is the distance between their <em>outer</em> faces, so those two surfaces are the whole measurement &mdash; everything else just carries them.</p>": "<p>两片淬硬的量爪<strong>向外</strong>顶住孔壁。量具读的是它们<em>外</em>侧面之间的距离，所以这两个面就是测量本身 &mdash; 其余部分只是把它们架住。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Tungsten carbide tips, lapped flat, for wear life in abrasive bores</li><li>The jaws have <strong>width</strong>: a closed instrument reads 5&nbsp;mm, not zero</li><li>Rock the instrument gently through the bore and take the <em>largest</em> reading &mdash; that is the true diameter</li></ul>": "<ul><li>硬质合金端头，研磨平整，在磨蚀性孔里耐磨</li><li>量爪本身有<strong>宽度</strong>：合拢时读数是 5&nbsp;mm，不是零</li><li>在孔内轻轻摆动量具，取<em>最大</em>读数 &mdash; 那才是真实直径</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Why the largest reading:</strong> any tilt measures a chord, not the diameter, and every chord is shorter. The maximum you can find is the only reading that can be right.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>为什么取最大值：</strong>只要歪一点，量到的就是弦而不是直径，而弦一定比直径短。你能找到的最大值，才是唯一可能正确的读数。</div>",
  "Driven by the spindle": "由测微螺杆驱动",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Structure</span><h3>Moving jaw</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">结构</span><h3>活动量爪</h3>",
  "<p>The jaw block on the end of the screw. Turning the thimble drives it away from the fixed jaw, so the jaws <strong>open</strong> as the reading grows &mdash; the opposite sense to an outside micrometer, whose faces close.</p>": "<p>装在螺杆末端的量爪块。转微分筒会把它推离固定量爪，所以读数变大时量爪是<strong>张开</strong>的 &mdash; 与外径千分尺相反，后者是测量面合拢。</p>",
  "<p>That reversal of direction is why the sleeve is engraved backwards; see <em>Scale on sleeve</em>.</p>": "<p>方向相反正是套筒反向标注的原因，参见<em>套筒刻度</em>。</p>",
  "The precision screw": "精密螺纹",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Adjustment</span><h3>Spindle</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">调整</span><h3>测微螺杆</h3>",
  "<p>The same 0.5&nbsp;mm-pitch screw as every other micrometer in this family (40&nbsp;TPI in the inch instrument). One turn opens the jaws by exactly one pitch, and 25&nbsp;mm of travel is all the screw has &mdash; the range comes from the jaws, not the screw.</p>": "<p>与这一族里其他千分尺一样的 0.5&nbsp;mm 螺距螺纹（英制为 40 牙/英寸）。转一圈量爪正好张开一个螺距，螺杆总共只有 25&nbsp;mm 行程 &mdash; 量程来自量爪，不是螺杆。</p>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Pitch</dt><dd>0.5 mm (40 TPI imperial)</dd><dt>Travel</dt><dd>25 mm / 1 in</dd><dt>Least count</dt><dd>0.01 mm / 0.001 in</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>螺距</dt><dd>0.5 mm（英制 40 TPI）</dd><dt>行程</dt><dd>25 mm / 1 in</dd><dt>最小分度值</dt><dd>0.01 mm / 0.001 in</dd></dl>",
  "Locking lever": "锁紧手柄",
  "Holds the reading": "锁定读数",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Adjustment</span><h3>Locking lever</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">调整</span><h3>锁紧手柄</h3>",
  "<p>A small lever on the barrel neck that clamps the spindle, so the setting survives being worked back out of the bore. On an inside micrometer this matters more than on any other pattern: you cannot read the scales while the jaws are down a hole.</p>": "<p>套筒颈部的一个小手柄，把螺杆夹住，这样量具从孔里退出来时尺寸还能保住。对内径千分尺来说这一点比其他型式都重要：量爪在孔里的时候你根本没法看刻度。</p>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Sequence:</strong> find the largest reading, lock, withdraw, then read. Withdrawing an unlocked instrument drags the jaws on the bore and moves the setting.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>顺序：</strong>先找到最大读数，锁紧，退出来，再读数。没锁就往外退，量爪会在孔壁上拖，尺寸就变了。</div>",
  "Sleeve (barrel)": "固定套筒",
  "Carries the main scale": "承载主尺刻度",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Reading</span><h3>Sleeve (barrel)</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">读数</span><h3>固定套筒</h3>",
  "<p>The fixed tube the thimble screws along, carrying the main scale. As on the depth micrometer, the thimble <strong>covers</strong> it as the reading grows.</p>": "<p>微分筒在上面旋转前进的不动管件，刻着主尺刻度。与深度千分尺一样，读数变大时微分筒是把套筒<strong>盖住</strong>的。</p>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Graduated</dt><dd>0.5 mm per division</dd><dt>Span</dt><dd>25 mm of screw travel</dd><dt>Direction</dt><dd>Numbered in reverse</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>分度</dt><dd>每格 0.5 mm</dd><dt>跨距</dt><dd>螺杆行程 25 mm</dd><dt>方向</dt><dd>反向标注</dd></dl>",
  "Scale on sleeve": "套筒刻度",
  "Numbered BACKWARDS": "反向标注",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Reading</span><h3>Scale on sleeve &mdash; and why it runs backwards</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">读数</span><h3>套筒刻度 &mdash; 以及它为什么反向</h3>",
  "<p>The spindle extends <em>away</em> from the reading end as the jaws open, so the thimble travels towards the jaws and covers the sleeve. The sleeve is engraved to suit, and the main scale value is <strong>the first number hidden by the thimble</strong> &mdash; exactly as on a depth micrometer, and exactly the opposite of an outside one.</p>": "<p>量爪张开时，测微螺杆是<em>朝远离读数端的方向</em>伸出的，于是微分筒向量爪一侧移动、把套筒盖住。套筒因此按相反方向刻字，主尺读数就是<strong>微分筒盖住的第一个数字</strong> &mdash; 与深度千分尺完全一样，与外径千分尺完全相反。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Reading it the familiar way returns <strong>range &minus; actual</strong></li><li>Switch this simulator between Outside and Inside at the same setting and watch the numbering reverse</li></ul>": "<ul><li>按熟悉的方式去读，得到的是<strong>量程 &minus; 实际值</strong></li><li>在同一个尺寸下把本模拟器从 Outside 切到 Inside，就能看到数字反向</li></ul>",
  "Turned to open the jaws": "转动以张开量爪",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Adjustment</span><h3>Thimble</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">调整</span><h3>微分筒</h3>",
  "<p>50 divisions of 0.01&nbsp;mm around the bevel (25 of 0.001&Prime; in the inch instrument). Identical to the outside micrometer&rsquo;s &mdash; the arithmetic TR = MSR + (CSR &times; LC) is unchanged; only the direction and the jaw offset differ.</p>": "<p>斜口上一圈 50 格、每格 0.01&nbsp;mm（英制为 25 格、每格 0.001&Prime;）。与外径千分尺完全相同 &mdash; 算式 TR = MSR + (CSR &times; LC) 不变，变化的只是方向和李爪宽度偏移。</p>",
  "Repeatable jaw pressure": "可重复的量爪压力",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Adjustment</span><h3>Ratchet stop</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">调整</span><h3>棘轮止动器</h3>",
  "<p>Slips at a set torque so the jaws are opened against the bore with the same force every time. Over-tighten an inside micrometer and you do not compress the work &mdash; you spring the frame and bell-mouth the reading.</p>": "<p>在设定扭矩下打滑，使每次张开顶住孔壁的力都一样。内径千分尺夹过头，压的不是工件 &mdash; 而是把尺架撑变形，读数会跟着跑。</p>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Feel matters here:</strong> rock for the maximum while the ratchet is slipping, not before.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>这里手感很关键：</strong>要在棘轮打滑的同时摆动找最大值，而不是摆动完了再去顶。</div>",
  "Bridges the reference surface": "跨在基准面上",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Structure</span><h3>Base</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">结构</span><h3>底座</h3>",
  "<p>The flat casting that spans the hole or slot and rests on the surface you are measuring <em>from</em>. Everything the instrument reports is referred to this one face, so its flatness is the accuracy of the measurement.</p>": "<p>那块跨在孔或槽上、落在被测基准面上的平板铸件。量具报出的一切都以这个面为基准，所以它的平面度就是测量的准确度。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Typical bases run 63.5&nbsp;mm or 101.6&nbsp;mm long &mdash; longer bridges span wider slots but need a flatter surface</li><li>Must sit on a surface that is flat and clean; a chip under the base is a direct error</li><li>Held down by hand pressure only &mdash; rocking it changes the reading</li></ul>": "<ul><li>常见底座长 63.5&nbsp;mm 或 101.6&nbsp;mm &mdash; 越长能跨的槽越宽，但对基准面平面度要求越高</li><li>必须落在平整干净的面上；底座下面夹一颗铁屑就是直接误差</li><li>只靠手压住 &mdash; 晃一动读数就变</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Workshop habit:</strong> press the base down firmly at BOTH ends before turning the ratchet. A base that lifts at one end reads shallow.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>车间习惯：</strong>转棘轮之前，先把底座<em>两端</em>都压紧。一端翘起来，读数就偏浅。</div>",
  "Reference plane": "基准面",
  "The face the depth is measured from": "深度的起算面",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Measuring</span><h3>Reference plane</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">测量</span><h3>基准面</h3>",
  "<p>The lapped underside of the base. Zero is set when the rod tip is exactly flush with this plane, which is why a depth micrometer is zeroed <strong>on a surface plate or a gauge block</strong>, never in mid-air.</p>": "<p>底座经过研磨的下表面。测杆端头与此面齐平时就是零位，所以深度千分尺对零必须<strong>在平板或量块上</strong>做，绝不能在空气中对。</p>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Finish</dt><dd>Lapped flat</dd><dt>Zero check</dt><dd>Rod flush on a surface plate</dd><dt>Reads</dt><dd>0.00 mm at full retraction</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>表面</dt><dd>研磨平整</dd><dt>对零</dt><dd>在平板上让测杆齐平</dd><dt>读数</dt><dd>测杆完全退回时为 0.00 mm</dd></dl>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Check it:</strong> stand the base on a surface plate and run the rod down to contact. It must read exactly zero &mdash; anything else is a zero error to be applied to every reading.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>检查方法：</strong>把底座立在平板上，让测杆下落接触。读数必须正好是零 &mdash; 否则就是零误差，之后每个读数都要修正。</div>",
  "Extension rod": "接长杆",
  "Interchangeable &mdash; sets the range": "可更换 &mdash; 决定量程",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Measuring</span><h3>Extension rod</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">测量</span><h3>接长杆</h3>",
  "<p>The screw itself only travels <strong>25&nbsp;mm (or 1&nbsp;inch)</strong>. Range beyond that comes from swapping the rod, in 25&nbsp;mm / 1&nbsp;in steps &mdash; 0&ndash;25, 25&ndash;50, 50&ndash;75, 75&ndash;100&nbsp;mm and so on.</p>": "<p>螺杆本身只有 <strong>25&nbsp;mm（或 1&nbsp;英寸）</strong>行程。更大的量程靠换接长杆实现，按 25&nbsp;mm / 1&nbsp;in 一档 &mdash; 0&ndash;25、25&ndash;50、50&ndash;75、75&ndash;100&nbsp;mm 以此类推。</p>",
  "<ul><li>The rod&rsquo;s base value <strong>adds</strong> to whatever the screw reads: a 50&ndash;75&nbsp;mm rod showing 12.34 on the scales is a depth of <strong>62.34&nbsp;mm</strong></li><li>The lapped end is the measuring face &mdash; never let it strike the bottom of the hole</li><li>Rods are clamped by the lock ring and must be seated fully before the cap is tightened</li></ul>": "<ul><li>接长杆的基准值要<strong>加</strong>到螺杆读出的数上：50&ndash;75&nbsp;mm 的杆，刻度显示 12.34，实际深度是 <strong>62.34&nbsp;mm</strong></li><li>研磨过的那一端是测量面 &mdash; 绝不要让它撞孔底</li><li>接长杆由锁紧环夹紧，拧紧前必须完全就位</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>The classic slip:</strong> reading the scales perfectly and then forgetting the rod. Check which rod is fitted <em>before</em> you write the number down.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>最经典的失误：</strong>刻度读得完美，却忘了接长杆。写数<em>之前</em>先确认装的是哪根杆。</div>",
  "Clamps the rod and the setting": "夹紧接长杆并锁住尺寸",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Adjustment</span><h3>Lock ring</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">调整</span><h3>锁紧环</h3>",
  "<p>The knurled collar that clamps the extension rod in its seat. It is not the spindle lock &mdash; that is the separate lever further along the barrel, which is what freezes a reading so it can be carried away from the work.</p>": "<p>把接长杆夹在座里的滚花环。它不是螺杆锁 &mdash; 螺杆锁是套筒上更靠后的另一个手柄，它负责把读数冻住，好让量具离开工件。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Finger-tight only &mdash; a rod over-clamped can be pushed off its seat</li><li>Loosen fully before changing rods, or the seat is scored</li></ul>": "<ul><li>手指拧紧即可 &mdash; 夹过头反而会把杆顶离座</li><li>换杆前要完全松开，否则会把座面拉伤</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>After every rod change:</strong> re-zero on a surface plate. A rod that is not fully seated is a constant error on every reading that follows.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>每次换杆之后：</strong>都要在平板上重新对零。接长杆没完全就位，会在之后每个读数上带来一个固定误差。</div>",
  "<p>The fixed tube the thimble screws along. It carries the main scale, and on a depth micrometer the thimble <strong>covers</strong> it as the rod goes deeper &mdash; the opposite of an outside micrometer, where the thimble uncovers the sleeve.</p>": "<p>微分筒在上面旋转前进的不动管件，刻着主尺刻度。在深度千分尺上，测杆越深微分筒把套筒盖得越多 &mdash; 与外径千分尺相反，后者是微分筒把套筒露出来。</p>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Graduated</dt><dd>0.5 mm per division (metric)</dd><dt>Span</dt><dd>25 mm / 1 in per rod</dd><dt>Direction</dt><dd>Numbered head &rarr; thimble</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>分度</dt><dd>每格 0.5 mm（公制）</dd><dt>跨距</dt><dd>每根杆 25 mm / 1 in</dd><dt>方向</dt><dd>由头部向微分筒方向标注</dd></dl>",
  "<p>The single thing that makes a depth micrometer different to read. The screw drives the rod <em>into</em> the hole, so the thimble travels <strong>towards the base</strong> as the depth grows. The sleeve is therefore numbered from the head towards the thimble, and the main scale reading is <strong>the first number hidden by the thimble</strong> &mdash; not the last one revealed.</p>": "<p>深度千分尺读法与众不同的唯一原因。螺杆把测杆送<em>进</em>孔里，所以深度越大，微分筒越<strong>靠近底座</strong>。因此套筒是从头部向微分筒方向标注的，主尺读数就是<strong>微分筒盖住的第一个数字</strong> &mdash; 而不是露出来的最后一个。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Zero sits at <strong>full retraction</strong>, with the thimble at the far end of the sleeve</li><li>Read it like an outside micrometer and you get <strong>range &minus; actual</strong>: on a 25&nbsp;mm instrument a true 6&nbsp;mm depth reads as 19&nbsp;mm</li><li>The thimble numbers run the opposite way too, so turning to go deeper still counts up</li></ul>": "<ul><li>零位在<strong>完全退回</strong>时，此时微分筒在套筒的最远端</li><li>按外径千分尺的方式去读，得到的是<strong>量程 &minus; 实际值</strong>：25&nbsp;mm 的量具上，真实的 6&nbsp;mm 深会读成 19&nbsp;mm</li><li>微分筒上的数字也是反向排列的，所以往深处转仍然是往上计数</li></ul>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>This is the commonest depth-micrometer error there is.</strong> Switch this simulator between Outside and Depth at the same setting and watch the sleeve numbers reverse.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>这是深度千分尺最常见的错误。</strong>在同一尺寸下把本模拟器从 Outside 切到 Depth，就能看到套筒数字反过来。</div>",
  "Turned to drive the rod": "转动以推动测杆",
  "<p>The knurled drum fixed to the screw. One full turn advances the rod by exactly one pitch &mdash; 0.5&nbsp;mm on the metric instrument, 0.025&nbsp;in on the 40&nbsp;TPI inch one.</p>": "<p>固定在螺杆上的滚花筒。转一圈，测杆正好前进一个螺距 &mdash; 公制 0.5&nbsp;mm，英制（40 TPI）0.025&nbsp;in。</p>",
  "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>Pitch</dt><dd>0.5 mm (40 TPI imperial)</dd><dt>Divisions</dt><dd>50 (25 imperial)</dd><dt>Least count</dt><dd>0.01 mm / 0.001 in</dd></dl>": "<dl class=\"pi-spec\"><dt>螺距</dt><dd>0.5 mm（英制 40 TPI）</dd><dt>分度数</dt><dd>50（英制 25）</dd><dt>最小分度值</dt><dd>0.01 mm / 0.001 in</dd></dl>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Same screw as an outside micrometer.</strong> The arithmetic TR = MSR + (CSR &times; LC) is unchanged &mdash; only the direction of travel and the numbering differ.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>与外径千分尺同一套螺杆。</strong>算式 TR = MSR + (CSR &times; LC) 不变 &mdash; 变化的只是行进方向和标注方向。</div>",
  "Circumferential scale": "周向刻度",
  "50 divisions on the thimble": "微分筒上 50 个分度",
  "<span class=\"pi-tag\">Reading</span><h3>Circumferential scale</h3>": "<span class=\"pi-tag\">读数</span><h3>周向刻度</h3>",
  "<p>The 50 divisions engraved round the thimble bevel. Each one is 0.01&nbsp;mm of rod travel, read against the datum line on the sleeve exactly as on an outside micrometer.</p>": "<p>微分筒斜口上一圈的 50 个分度，每格对应测杆前进 0.01&nbsp;mm，与套筒上的基准线对齐读数，和外径千分尺完全一样。</p>",
  "<ul><li>Metric: 0.5&nbsp;mm &divide; 50 = <strong>0.01&nbsp;mm</strong></li><li>Imperial: 0.025&Prime; &divide; 25 = <strong>0.001&Prime;</strong></li><li>Numbered in the reverse rotational sense, so sinking the rod still counts up</li></ul>": "<ul><li>公制：0.5&nbsp;mm &divide; 50 = <strong>0.01&nbsp;mm</strong></li><li>英制：0.025&Prime; &divide; 25 = <strong>0.001&Prime;</strong></li><li>按相反的旋转方向标注数字，所以测杆下沉仍然是往上计数</li></ul>",
  "Sets a repeatable contact force": "提供可重复的接触力",
  "<p>Slips at a preset torque so every operator lands the rod on the bottom of the hole with the same force &mdash; about 5&ndash;10&nbsp;N. On a depth micrometer it matters more than on an outside one, because you cannot feel the contact through the frame.</p>": "<p>在设定扭矩下打滑，让每个人让测杆落到孔底的力都一样 &mdash; 大约 5&ndash;10&nbsp;N。在深度千分尺上这一点比外径千分尺更重要，因为你隔着尺架感觉不到接触。</p>",
  "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>Always finish on the ratchet.</strong> Driving the rod down by the thimble can lift the base off the reference surface, which reads deep and can bruise the rod tip.</div>": "<div class=\"pi-tip\"><strong>最后一定要用棘轮收尾。</strong>用微分筒把测杆压下去，会把底座顶离基准面，读数偏深，还可能磕伤测杆端头。</div>",
  "Anvil": "测砧",
  "Spindle": "测微螺杆",
  "Main Scale": "主尺",
  "Thimble": "微分筒",
  "Ratchet Stop": "棘轮止动器",
  "Ratchet stop": "棘轮止动器",
  "Carbide jaws": "硬质合金量爪",
  "Moving jaw": "活动量爪",
  "Base": "底座",
  "Lock ring": "锁紧环"
}